From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Playport contributors <playport@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:08:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: place and relocate i386 images in guest space

Honor guest ASLR hints and search owner-local holdbacks on collision. Validate i386 fixups before applying Wine relocation blocks with guest deltas only. Suppress the server host-versus-guest NOT_AT_BASE warning after completed mapping, preventing a second native relocation by B. Keep the startup loader boundary closed.

Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-03-portal2-wine-window.md
Offered-upstream: no (iOS pseudo-process window port)
---
